        "name": "Poincare.ParabolicGraphTimeJets.finite_time_transfer",
        "lean_type": "∀ (E : Type u) [NormedAddCommGroup E] [NormedSpace ℝ E]\n(ι : Type v) [Fintype ι] (α T : ℝ)\n(G : Poincare.ParabolicSolutionGraph.Graph (E := E) α T)\n(W : ι → Poincare.ParabolicSolutionGraph.Graph (E := E) α T)\n(a : ι → ℝ) (x : E) (xs : ι → E), 0 < T →\n(∀ s ∈ Set.Icc 0 T, G.u (s,x) = ∑ i, a i * (W i).u (s,xs i)) →\n∀ t ∈ Set.Icc 0 T, G.ut (t,x) = ∑ i, a i * (W i).ut (t,xs i)",
        "universes": [
          "u",
          "v"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Poincare.ParabolicGraphTimeJets.tensor_time_covariance",
        "lean_type": "∀ (α T : ℝ) (U V : Poincare.DeTurckCoupledForcing.Inputs α T) (phi : Poincare.ClosedSmoothModel 3 → Poincare.ClosedSmoothModel 3)\n(J : Poincare.ClosedSmoothModel 3 →L[ℝ] Poincare.ClosedSmoothModel 3) (z : Poincare.ClosedSmoothModel 3) (t : ℝ),\n0 < T → t ∈ Set.Icc 0 T →\nFilter.Eventually\n (fun s => Poincare.DeTurckCoupledForcing.tensorValue U (s,z) =\n  Poincare.pullbackBilinearForm\n   (Poincare.DeTurckCoupledForcing.tensorValue V (s,phi z)) J)\n (nhdsWithin t (Set.Icc 0 T)) →\nlet TT := fun (W : Poincare.DeTurckCoupledForcing.Inputs α T) (p : ℝ × Poincare.ClosedSmoothModel 3) =>\n ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,\n  (W (a,b)).ut p • Poincare.DeTurckTensorBasis.tensor a b\nTT U (t,z) = Poincare.pullbackBilinearForm (TT V (t,phi z)) J",
        "universes": []
      }
    ],
